[Options]

[A.]
<h2>Storm Transport</h2>
<i>"Time is money!"<br>
--Unknown</i>  

<p>The last battle took many resources from DDC. Word is, the Razorians are transporting a large shipment of Storm Power to their center. Stealing it would have two advantadges: The Razorians would lose a great amount of Storm Power, and DDC's supply will be full again.

<p>Your mission is to defeat the Razorians and steal the Storm Power.

$Button=Review Knowledge,ShowTechnology,55
$Button=Play Mission,DoNothing,0

[BadTeamDead]
<h2>Well done!</h2>
<p>
Great battle! Now we can try some assaults on the Razorians` center!

<$Config,Done{mission.filename}=1>
$Button=Leave Missions,MissionAbort,0
$Button=Next Mission,MissionBegin,Razorianreturn5

[Failed]
<h2>Failure!</h2>
<p>
You are dead! Without the Storm Power, DDC hasn't much chance of surviving!

$Button=Continue,Tell,TryAgain

[END]